article en "Browser source-position slice"
body
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence cons text "This standalone test adapter calls the actual " cons code "nepl3-core" cons text " SourceSnapshot and LineIndex APIs. " nil
    cons "It is not a production API, a JavaScript reimplementation, or a formal E01 acceptance decision. "
    cons "It has no new production dependencies."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "The ABI version is 1. "
    cons "Fixture IDs 0, 1 and 2 identify respectively the fixed BOM/Japanese/emoji/mixed-line-ending input, empty input, and Japanese text ending in CRLF. "
    cons sentence cons text "Fixture 3 is the exact catalog " cons code "E-unicode" cons text " input " cons code "a𠮷b\\r\\n文書" cons text ": 14 UTF-8 bytes on two lines. " nil
    cons sentence cons text "Its supplementary-plane character occupies bytes [1, 5), UTF-16 columns [1, 3), and UTF-32 columns [1, 2) on line zero. " nil
    cons "The shared 228-case oracle includes both conversion directions at its seven valid boundaries, CRLF/scalar/surrogate interior rejection, and all previous 173 cases unchanged. "
    cons "The native/WASI test also checks that the named catalog source and range endpoints agree with these executed observations. "
    cons "Encoding IDs 0/1/2 mean UTF-8/UTF-16/UTF-32. "
    cons "Mismatch IDs 0/1/2/3 select the original snapshot or a changed revision/content/source ID. "
    cons "Unknown selectors return an adapter error rather than success."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence cons code "source_position" cons text " returns " cons code "(line << 32) | character" cons text "; " cons code "source_offset" cons text " returns a byte offset. " nil
    cons "Results with bit 63 set are errors: 1 Bounds, 2 ScalarBoundary, 3 LineTerminator, 4 Position, 5 SnapshotMismatch, 255 unexpected/adapter failure. "
    cons "Arguments and results use JavaScript BigInt, never Number for u64 values. "
    cons sentence cons text "The " cons code "source_byte" cons text " export binds exact UTF-8 fixture bytes, not merely their lengths. " nil
    cons sentence cons text "The Python oracle is fixed data in " cons code "conformance/inputs/browser/source-position.json" cons text "; it is not generated from either conversion operation." nil
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "On a Linux development host with the pinned Rust target and Playwright engines:"
    nil
  cons rawcode none "rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\npython -m pip install -r tools/audit/doc_html/requirements.txt\npython -m playwright install --with-deps chromium firefox webkit\npython -m unittest discover -s tools/emulators/browser -p 'test_*.py'\npython tools/emulators/browser/run.py --repository . --output dist/browser-foundation\n"
  cons paragraph
    cons "Commit source first; the runner rejects dirty source and reused output directories. "
    cons "It builds the Wasm from its own checkout, executes all cases in all three engines, and retains raw stdout/stderr, command status, versions, source/input/binary hashes, and observations. "
    cons sentence cons text "Each engine runs with a wall-clock deadline and Linux " cons code "/proc" cons text " descendant tracking, including detached browser children. " nil
    cons "Cleanup uses PID/start-time identity across reparenting, tries SIGTERM, then SIGKILL and verifies termination; a hung synchronous Wasm call fails instead of being skipped. "
    cons "Failed runs retain their output and cannot be presented as passed receipts. "
    cons "The runner is for trusted development inputs, not an arbitrary-code sandbox. "
    cons "Clean-checkout checks before/after do not detect transient edits or authenticate execution."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence cons text "Raw logs, " cons code "fixture.wasm" cons text ", and receipts belong in " cons code "dist/" cons text " or CI artifacts, not " cons code "conformance/results/" cons text ". " nil
    cons "Artifact retention is 14 days in CI. "
    cons "This browser slice does not assemble seven-target AcceptanceEvidence, prove LKG/publication, or change any acceptance status. "
    cons "Missing engines and failed checks are failures."
    nil
  nil
